    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Truncated SVD:** We keep only the top $k$ singular values ($k \\ll r$) to reduce noise and capture latent semantics:\n",
        "$$\n",
        "A_{m \\times n} \\approx A_k = U_{m \\times k} \\, \\Sigma_{k \\times k} \\, V^T_{k \\times n}\n",
        "$$"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "lrY1aI-RgCyS"
      },
      "id": "lrY1aI-RgCyS"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "k = 3\n",
        "\n",
        "U_k = U[:, 1:k]\n",
        "S_k = Diagonal(S[1:k])\n",
        "Vt_k = transpose(V)[1:k, :]\n",
        "\n",
        "Atrunc = U_k * S_k * Vt_k"
      ],
      "metadata": {
