    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Latent Dirichlet Allocation (LDA)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "sHN-XYVCnwGk"
      },
      "id": "sHN-XYVCnwGk"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**LDA** is a probabilistic generative model that represents documents as mixtures of topics, where each topic is a distribution over words, commonly used for topic modeling and document clustering.\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "p(\\mathbf{w},\\mathbf{z},\\boldsymbol{\\theta},\\boldsymbol{\\phi}\\mid\\alpha,\\beta)\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\left[\n",
        "\\prod_{k=1}^{K}\n",
        "p(\\boldsymbol{\\phi}_k\\mid\\beta)\n",
        "\\right]\n",
        "\\left[\n",
        "\\prod_{d=1}^{D}\n",
        "p(\\boldsymbol{\\theta}_d\\mid\\alpha)\n",
        "\\prod_{n=1}^{N_d}\n",
        "p(z_{dn}\\mid\\boldsymbol{\\theta}_d)\n",
        "p(w_{dn}\\mid \\boldsymbol{\\phi}_{z_{dn}})\n",
        "\\right]\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "1. $K$: number of topics.\n",
        "1. $V$: vocabulary size.\n",
        "1. $D$: number of documents.\n",
        "1. $N_d$: number of words in document $d$.\n",
        "1. $\\alpha$: Dirichlet parameter controlling document-topic mixtures.\n",
        "1. $\\beta$: Dirichlet parameter controlling topic-word mixtures.\n",
        "1. $\\theta_d$: topic proportions of document $d$ *(latent)*.\n",
        "1. $\\phi_k$: word probabilities of topic $k$ *(latent)*.\n",
        "1. $z_{dn}$: topic assigned to word $n$ in document $d$ *(latent)*.\n",
        "1. $w_{dn}$: observed word.\n",
        "\n",
        "**LDA** assumes that each document has a Dirichlet-distributed mixture of topics, and each topic has a Dirichlet-distributed mixture of words. For every word, a categorical distribution first selects a topic from the document's topic mixture, then another categorical distribution selects the word from that topic. The overall generative process as follows:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\begin{array}{c@{\\qquad}c@{\\qquad}c@{\\qquad}c}\n",
        "\\underbrace{\\phi}_{\\text{topic-word distributions}}\n",
        "&\\longrightarrow&\n",
        "\\underbrace{\\theta}_{\\text{document-topic distributions}}\n",
        "&\\longrightarrow&\n",
        "\\underbrace{z}_{\\text{topic assignments}}\n",
        "&\\longrightarrow&\n",
        "\\underbrace{w}_{\\text{observed words}}\n",
        "\\end{array}\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "**Dirichlet:** generates a distribution of probabilities\n",
        "\n",
        "\\begin{aligned}\n",
        "\\boldsymbol{\\theta}_d &\\sim \\operatorname{Dirichlet}(\\alpha), \\\\\n",
        "\\boldsymbol{\\phi}_k &\\sim \\operatorname{Dirichlet}(\\beta).\n",
        "\\end{aligned}\n",
        "\n",
        "**Categorical:** uses those probabilities to choose one category\n",
        "\n",
        "\\begin{aligned}\n",
        "z_{dn} &\\sim \\operatorname{Categorical}(\\boldsymbol{\\theta}_d), \\\\\n",
        "w_{dn} &\\sim \\operatorname{Categorical}(\\boldsymbol{\\phi}_{z_{dn}}).\n",
        "\\end{aligned}\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "1ejpm6pIKsw4"
      },
      "id": "1ejpm6pIKsw4"
    },
